
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  blue-data-web-source — BFS Crawler Demo
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  MOCK SITE STRUCTURE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    /             → links to /research, /news, /about, [external]
    /research     → links to /research/ai, /research/climate
    /news         → links to /news/2026-01, /news/2026-02
    /about        → no outbound links
    /research/ai  → links back to /research (already seen)

  EXPERIMENT 1 — depth=1  (seed + its direct links)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  depth=1 result
    Pages crawled : 4
    Chunks stored : 4
       1 chunks  /  (Research Institute)
       1 chunks  /about  (About the Institute)
       1 chunks  /news  (Institute News)
       1 chunks  /research  (Research Areas)

  ✓  External URL 'https://external.org/partner' not crawled (same_domain_only=True)

  EXPERIMENT 2 — depth=2  (seed + links + links-of-links)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  depth=2 result
    Pages crawled : 8
    Chunks stored : 8
       1 chunks  /  (Research Institute)
       1 chunks  /about  (About the Institute)
       1 chunks  /news  (Institute News)
       1 chunks  /news/2026-01  (January 2026 News)
       1 chunks  /news/2026-02  (February 2026 News)
       1 chunks  /research  (Research Areas)
       1 chunks  /research/ai  (AI Research Group)
       1 chunks  /research/climate  (Climate Research Group)

  EXPERIMENT 3 — max_pages=3  (early stop)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  max_pages=3 result
    Pages crawled : 3
    Chunks stored : 3
       1 chunks  /  (Research Institute)
       1 chunks  /news  (Institute News)
       1 chunks  /research  (Research Areas)

  ✓  Crawl stops after 3 pages regardless of remaining links in the queue

  EXPERIMENT 4 — same_domain_only=False  (follows external links)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  same_domain_only=False, depth=1
    Pages crawled : 5
    Chunks stored : 5
       1 chunks  https://external.org/partner  (Partner Organisation)
       1 chunks  /  (Research Institute)
       1 chunks  /about  (About the Institute)
       1 chunks  /news  (Institute News)
       1 chunks  /research  (Research Areas)
  ✓  External URL included: https://external.org/partner

  COMPARISON TABLE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Config                               Pages  Chunks
  ─────────────────────────────────── ────── ───────
  depth=1, max_pages=20, same_domain       4       4
  depth=2, max_pages=20, same_domain       8       8
  depth=2, max_pages=3,  same_domain       3       3
  depth=1, max_pages=20, cross_domain      5       5

  Notes:
   • depth counts hops from seed (depth=1 = seed + its links)
   • max_pages is a hard cap regardless of depth
   • BFS visits pages in breadth-first order — max_pages cuts the queue
   • URL dedup is hash-based; back-links to already-seen pages are skipped

